WEBVTT

00:15.670 --> 00:18.500
I never dreamed before

00:18.500 --> 00:21.340
I'm gonna knock the door

00:21.340 --> 00:24.910
into the world of perfect free

00:24.910 --> 00:27.010
(You ain't no lonely!)

00:27.010 --> 00:29.850
You're gonna say I'm lying

00:29.850 --> 00:32.580
I'm gonna get the chance

00:32.580 --> 00:36.150
I thought a chance is far from me

00:36.150 --> 00:37.320
(You ain't no lonely!)

00:37.320 --> 00:40.230
I was made to hit in America

00:40.230 --> 00:43.090
(I was made to hit in America)

00:43.090 --> 00:49.000
I was made to hit in America

00:49.000 --> 00:52.670
You are the sun, you are the star

00:52.670 --> 00:54.670
(To me, forever)

00:54.670 --> 00:58.380
You are the sun, you are the star

00:58.380 --> 01:01.610
(To me, forever)

01:08.450 --> 01:14.060
I was made to hit in America

01:14.060 --> 01:16.900
I was made to hit in America

01:16.900 --> 01:19.760
(I was made to hit in America)

01:19.760 --> 01:22.570
I was made to hit in America

01:22.570 --> 01:25.340
(I was made to hit in America)

01:25.340 --> 01:33.210
I was made to hit in America

01:36.250 --> 01:42.090
"Fishing Hole"

01:42.090 --> 01:43.220
"Fishing Hole"

01:42.090 --> 01:43.220
Hey! The thing you asked
your friend for came!

01:43.220 --> 01:47.120
Hey! The thing you asked
your friend for came!

01:52.260 --> 01:56.270
Oh that. You brought it for me.

01:56.270 --> 01:57.440
Yeah...

01:57.440 --> 02:01.270
I wanted to see the joy in your face.

02:01.270 --> 02:02.540
Hmm...

02:05.440 --> 02:07.170
This is great.

02:19.650 --> 02:21.810
You're Maho-chan, right?

02:23.680 --> 02:24.740
Huh?

02:29.820 --> 02:32.690
And you were...Izumi-chan?

02:35.160 --> 02:38.000
And it says, "I love New York."

02:38.000 --> 02:41.270
And I got to touch him
when he was running away.

02:41.270 --> 02:43.940
Huh? You touched him?

02:43.940 --> 02:45.130
Neat!

02:51.450 --> 02:53.210
I wanted to talk to you.

02:58.620 --> 03:00.790
Do you have some time now?

03:00.790 --> 03:01.960
Nope.

03:01.960 --> 03:03.790
Oh...

03:03.790 --> 03:06.490
Hmm...Ten minutes is all I need.

03:08.130 --> 03:10.650
Tea? My treat.

03:26.480 --> 03:31.490
I don't know what happened
between you and Maho.

03:31.490 --> 03:32.920
And I don't care.

03:36.160 --> 03:37.920
But...

03:37.920 --> 03:40.090
Hey Koyuki...

03:40.090 --> 03:44.620
The stronger a person looks,
the weaker he is.

03:48.940 --> 03:52.410
Maho looks strong,

03:52.410 --> 03:54.770
but at home, she cries all the time.

04:12.790 --> 04:16.960
Anyway, I have no right to lecture you.

04:26.310 --> 04:27.770
Go!

04:31.140 --> 04:36.170
So what...how do you feel
about my kid sister?

05:25.970 --> 05:27.130
Huh?

05:27.130 --> 05:29.300
Where's Koyuki?

05:29.300 --> 05:32.070
Huh? He went to look for Maho.

05:32.070 --> 05:32.970
Huh?

05:32.970 --> 05:36.840
Maho went to return a video
and hasn't returned for three hours.

05:38.950 --> 05:41.310
Maho?

05:41.310 --> 05:44.820
Don't tell me he's gonna miss
this important meeting for a date!

05:44.820 --> 05:47.590
-Huh? Date?
-That Koyuki!

05:47.590 --> 05:49.590
Here...I brought something.

05:49.590 --> 05:50.820
Thanks.

06:29.660 --> 06:34.170
"Neighborhood Watch-
Work together to prevent crime"

06:34.170 --> 06:39.230
"Liquor, Cigarettes"
"Exciting Town"

06:46.780 --> 06:48.080
Uh?

06:48.080 --> 06:49.280
Huh?

07:28.290 --> 07:30.790
See you, Koyuki.

07:30.790 --> 07:34.160
Huh? Izumi-chan...

07:36.130 --> 07:38.360
Good-bye, Koyuki.

08:11.430 --> 08:13.660
Good-bye, Koyuki.

08:19.940 --> 08:22.940
I don't understand Japanese thinking.

08:22.940 --> 08:24.280
Huh?

08:24.280 --> 08:28.110
She hunted me down just to tell me...

08:28.110 --> 08:32.210
that there's nothing between you and her.

08:35.960 --> 08:41.120
At first I thought,
"What the hell do you want?"

08:42.730 --> 08:46.400
After talking to her...
man, she's really nice.

08:46.400 --> 08:51.030
But she seems more like your older sister.

08:58.080 --> 08:59.910
Want to go eat a burger?

08:59.910 --> 09:03.080
Err...no. Ryusuke was worried.

09:03.080 --> 09:04.140
No shit?

09:05.250 --> 09:09.020
But he never acts like a big brother...

09:14.590 --> 09:16.930
Not that article again?

09:16.930 --> 09:18.960
Why're you so stuck on it?

09:21.270 --> 09:24.900
At one time, Eddy and Erica used to date.

09:28.440 --> 09:33.110
We had gone to the
Appollon Theater Amateur Night

09:33.110 --> 09:35.880
and saw Erica before she debuted.

09:38.220 --> 09:42.220
Her powerful singing voice blew me away.

09:42.220 --> 09:48.060
That was the one and only time
we ever waited for someone backstage.

09:48.060 --> 09:53.570
But Eddy and Erica couldn't
get past their problems.

09:53.570 --> 09:55.430
Their relationship didn't last long.

09:57.970 --> 10:01.070
To think that someone
who had such strong vibes

10:01.070 --> 10:05.070
would commit suicide like that...
I just can't believe it.

10:07.080 --> 10:08.180
Hmm...

10:08.180 --> 10:10.080
You think it was murder?

10:10.080 --> 10:12.640
Even the FBI is suspicious.

10:15.090 --> 10:17.890
And the one who benefited most
from Erica's death...

10:19.990 --> 10:21.520
Hmm...

10:22.600 --> 10:25.560
The rapper boyfriend...Malcolm.

10:29.440 --> 10:32.430
Yes. Thank you.

10:37.710 --> 10:39.710
Man, it's totally over.

10:39.710 --> 10:41.710
Hey, are you serious?!

10:41.710 --> 10:44.050
Then that offer from major label...

10:44.050 --> 10:47.490
Just means life ain't so easy.

10:49.660 --> 10:55.560
Wait! I know! Your letters
made the record company mad!

10:55.560 --> 10:56.230
Huh?

10:56.230 --> 11:02.740
Well look...During Dying Breed's
live performance, everything seemed fine!

11:02.740 --> 11:07.410
Well probably...Ran's power
is greater than we thought.

11:07.410 --> 11:08.410
Him?

11:08.410 --> 11:11.580
I get it. So that's how it is.

11:11.580 --> 11:16.420
On top of losing the debut
for Belle Ame, he became a back-up.

11:16.420 --> 11:19.320
He must be mad as hell.

11:24.420 --> 11:28.430
We got ourselves some enemy.

11:28.430 --> 11:31.990
Nah...We just didn't have it.

11:40.110 --> 11:44.280
Excuse me for having
a bad English accent!!

11:44.280 --> 11:46.880
You just don't progress!

11:46.880 --> 11:49.080
And you have a habit of mouthing off!

11:50.680 --> 11:55.620
-I think adding so many
notes about pronunciation...
-Don't lecture me!

11:55.620 --> 11:59.790
Hey Ryusuke...We've been practicing
so much, our motivation is down.

11:59.790 --> 12:02.960
When are we going to record?

12:02.960 --> 12:05.470
-Huh? Record?!
-Huh? Record?!

12:05.470 --> 12:10.160
We have to record the ultimate album,
one the industry won't be able to ignore.

12:15.480 --> 12:21.180
If we sit on our asses,
we'll never reach our dream!

12:35.330 --> 12:36.760
What?

12:36.760 --> 12:40.930
An all-night practice at
the studio again on Saturday night?!

12:40.930 --> 12:41.940
-Uh-huh.
-Uh-huh.

12:41.940 --> 12:44.100
You guys are in such a rush.

12:44.100 --> 12:46.940
Think so? It's been the norm lately.

12:46.940 --> 12:48.780
-Right?
-Yeah.

12:48.780 --> 12:51.950
Hmm...You're really working hard, huh?

12:51.950 --> 12:53.110
Huh?

12:53.110 --> 12:57.050
But hey, when you're famous,
I want your autographs.

13:09.130 --> 13:12.300
"Really working hard" huh?

13:12.300 --> 13:13.970
Isn't that him?

13:13.970 --> 13:17.140
Yeah! He was great
at the Culture Festival.

13:17.140 --> 13:19.640
I heard he performs at various live houses.

13:19.640 --> 13:20.330
Huh?

13:24.140 --> 13:25.580
Hey Tanaka!

13:29.320 --> 13:31.780
Come to my office.

13:31.780 --> 13:33.150
"Teachers' Office"

13:33.150 --> 13:34.250
"Teachers' Office"

13:33.150 --> 13:34.250
Huh!? That much?

13:34.250 --> 13:35.820
Huh!? That much?

13:35.820 --> 13:37.090
Is it a shock?

13:37.090 --> 13:40.560
But that's the reality for you right now.

13:40.560 --> 13:41.590
Oh...

13:41.590 --> 13:43.430
Tachi High is impossible.

13:43.430 --> 13:48.100
Toyonaga West is also a far reach.

13:48.100 --> 13:49.540
Err...I see.

13:49.540 --> 13:51.440
I'll get right to the point.

13:51.440 --> 13:54.460
You need to change your focus.

13:55.940 --> 13:59.280
You were once in the high middle ranking.

13:59.280 --> 14:01.340
Recently, you've plunged.

14:03.950 --> 14:07.450
Tanaka, it's fine to enjoy your youth.

14:07.450 --> 14:11.820
But the rest of your life is on the line.

14:56.440 --> 15:00.770
Yukio! It's late! Turn down the volume.

15:00.770 --> 15:02.170
All right.

15:09.280 --> 15:12.790
Koyuki-kun! Just like this-108 laps!

15:12.790 --> 15:14.950
It's impossible.

15:14.950 --> 15:18.080
I gave up in four.

15:19.630 --> 15:21.160
No!

15:21.160 --> 15:26.800
Koyuki-kun! You must do your best,
or your dreams will never come true!

15:26.800 --> 15:28.800
I know.

15:28.800 --> 15:30.970
Just like when I made it
on the Olympic team...

15:30.970 --> 15:32.940
when I declared my love
to that pretty bar hostess...

15:32.940 --> 15:36.140
I put my mind to it!

15:36.140 --> 15:41.010
And...your dream came true?

15:41.010 --> 15:43.680
Well...The past is the past
and the present is the present.

15:43.680 --> 15:44.580
Huh?

15:44.580 --> 15:48.920
My dream came true splendidly.

15:48.920 --> 15:50.620
I'm...going home.

16:01.600 --> 16:03.590
So warm!

16:05.610 --> 16:10.110
Cripes! Ryusuke is such a perfectionist!

16:10.110 --> 16:13.740
He's gonna die all alone
when he's old and gray.

16:15.550 --> 16:16.480
Huh?

16:20.790 --> 16:22.480
The hospital...

16:28.290 --> 16:29.960
Hey!

16:29.960 --> 16:32.300
He can't handle an all-nighter.

16:32.300 --> 16:33.800
You'll die, for real!

16:33.800 --> 16:34.630
No...

16:34.630 --> 16:38.240
It's an important time right now.

16:38.240 --> 16:41.240
I can't let the band down.

16:41.240 --> 16:42.500
-Hmm...
-Hmm...

16:59.590 --> 17:01.650
All right, once more.

17:10.940 --> 17:14.440
Hey! What're you doing, Koyuki?

17:14.440 --> 17:18.110
There's been no improvement 'cuz of you!

17:18.110 --> 17:19.950
I-I'm sorry.

17:19.950 --> 17:21.550
Hey, hey!

17:21.550 --> 17:24.620
Look, let's take a break.

17:24.620 --> 17:28.380
Uh-uh...Saku, take it from the top.

17:32.790 --> 17:34.490
One, two!

17:47.240 --> 17:49.470
Where is this?

18:08.590 --> 18:10.620
Where...

19:00.410 --> 19:03.420
Oh. Made a big mess.

19:03.420 --> 19:04.710
Too sad.

19:06.590 --> 19:08.020
I'll help.

19:10.420 --> 19:14.090
I'm cleaning up the mess
your concert had made.

20:19.260 --> 20:25.200
When I woke up, my fever, which had
been as high as 103, had gone down.

20:34.770 --> 20:41.840
And Beck's first album was completed
around the middle of winter break.

20:59.230 --> 21:07.570
Uh! Typhoon! Typhoon 24! 24-7, non-stop!

21:07.570 --> 21:12.750
We're gonna rush at you!
Gonna send you flyin'!

21:12.750 --> 21:14.580
Lift up your heavy ass, now

21:14.580 --> 21:16.750
If you take off that stiff head

21:16.750 --> 21:18.980
You'll feel totally loose...

21:24.090 --> 21:25.760
Isn't it great?

21:25.760 --> 21:26.820
Yeah.

21:49.620 --> 21:52.120
And I thought...

21:52.120 --> 21:55.110
What will I be doing with my life?

21:57.120 --> 21:58.460
Koyuki?

21:58.460 --> 22:00.290
Something up?

22:00.290 --> 22:02.800
Nah...Nothing.

22:02.800 --> 22:05.800
But Saku, have you been studying?

22:05.800 --> 22:07.200
Not at all.

22:26.820 --> 22:29.490
You really haven't been studying?

22:29.490 --> 22:32.950
Yup...I really, really
haven't been studying.

22:36.600 --> 22:40.530
Everything began with this one CD.

22:50.410 --> 22:52.510
Another minute

22:52.510 --> 22:55.200
Feelin' so fine

22:57.510 --> 22:59.750
You turn the freeze

22:59.750 --> 23:02.480
into warm light

23:04.590 --> 23:08.060
Had a premonition

23:08.060 --> 23:10.730
I've been waitin' ever since

23:10.730 --> 23:14.230
My world comin' down

23:14.230 --> 23:17.030
It's got me spinnin' 'round

23:18.800 --> 23:24.970
If you really wanna fly

23:24.970 --> 23:27.740
you gotta let go

23:39.990 --> 23:42.320
Simply the most

23:42.320 --> 23:44.360
big sensation

23:44.360 --> 23:47.160
(once you're here you won't go back)

23:47.160 --> 23:49.430
She's really pretty

23:49.430 --> 23:51.430
One-eyed vision

23:51.430 --> 23:54.270
(lose the fear it don't come back)

23:54.270 --> 23:57.770
Little sister showed me

23:57.770 --> 24:00.440
Really took me for a ride

24:00.440 --> 24:02.110
My world comin' down

24:02.110 --> 24:05.450
(once you're here you won't go back)

24:05.450 --> 24:09.470
(lose the fear it don't come back)

24:13.760 --> 24:16.930
It's almost over!
Let's run towards the sun!

24:16.930 --> 24:18.430
It's blinding!

24:18.430 --> 24:20.190
I wanna be Alain Delon!
